	(text "- 24 V entry from J1 / J2 / J3 bus net: polyfuse F1, reverse-polarity P-FET Q14, TVS D1 SMBJ28A\n- U8 60 V buck 24 V -> 5 V, >= 1 A (LMR36015 class). Check D1 clamp vs U8 abs max\n- U9 5 V -> 3V3 LDO, 1 A class (ESP32 Wi-Fi peaks)\n- 5 V rail feeds IR LED drive. 3V3 feeds ESP32, CAN VIO and TSOPs\n- VBUS sense: 100k / 10k divider to ESP32 ADC\n- Test points with adjacent GND: 5V, 3V3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 30 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
